# Top Services Revenue Analysis

## Objective

Identify the top three services generating the highest total charges for each patient.

## SQL Query

```sql
-- Can we identify our top 3 most expensive services for each patient?

WITH EXPENSIVE_SERVICES AS (
    SELECT 
        T.SERVICEPROVIDED,
        P.NAME,
        SUM(T.AMOUNTCHARGED) AS TOTAL_REVENUE
    FROM TRANSACTIONS T
    JOIN PATIENTRECORDS P 
        ON T.PatientID = P.PatientID
    GROUP BY T.SERVICEPROVIDED, P.NAME
),

TOP_SERVICES AS (
    SELECT 
        SERVICEPROVIDED,
        NAME,
        TOTAL_REVENUE,
        DENSE_RANK() OVER (
            PARTITION BY NAME 
            ORDER BY TOTAL_REVENUE DESC
        ) AS RANKING
    FROM EXPENSIVE_SERVICES
)

SELECT 
    SERVICEPROVIDED,
    NAME,
    TOTAL_REVENUE,
    RANKING
FROM TOP_SERVICES
WHERE RANKING <= 3;
```

