## Insight

Emergency Services generated the highest total charge among the services shown, with $300 recorded for both Jane Smith and Jessica Wilson. Other high-value services included the Kidney Function Lab Test for Olivia Martin at $170 and the Cholesterol Lab Test for Robert Thomas at $180. The results also show that several patients had fewer than three distinct services recorded in the dataset.
